{#
    Tabler form theme — Symfony's Bootstrap 5 form theme with Tabler's hints (`form-hint`) and the
    widgets of the bundle's form type extensions: `icon` (InputIcon), `stepper` (NumberInput),
    `choice_style` (SegmentedControl, Selectgroup) and `switch`.

        # config/packages/twig.yaml
        twig:
            form_themes: ['@TablerUxComponents/form/tabler_layout.html.twig']

    For labels beside their fields, use `tabler_horizontal_layout.html.twig` instead.
#}
